	quest.216A404B2C75EE3A.quest_desc: [
		"§7Combine §fCopper Ingots§7 and §fZinc Ingots§7 in a §fHeated Mixer§7 to create Brass Ingots."
		""
		"§7要获得最佳效果，这种合金的形成需要精确的温度控制。"
		""
