	quest.24FD5FE4188AA2A7.quest_desc: [
		"§7The Soul Elytra is an enhanced version of the standard Elytra, infused with sculk essence to provide improved flight capabilities."
		""
		"§6增强功能："
		"§7• 比普通鞘翅更耐用"
